1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,690
Dip three glass tubes of fine bore, narrower and narrower, into water.

2
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:08,424
The water climbs up each one on its own.

3
00:00:08,424 --> 00:00:11,419
And the thinner the tube, the higher it climbs.

4
00:00:11,419 --> 00:00:15,950
This rise or fall of liquid in a narrow tube is capillarity.

